// Production build only. tsconfig.json stays the whole project — editor and
// `tsc --noEmit` still typecheck the tests, which is the point: the Fix C
// review turned on fixtures that typecheck honestly, and dropping tests from
// the default config would quietly retire that guarantee.
//
// This config exists because the deploy box installs with NODE_ENV=production,
// so devDependencies are absent and `import from 'vitest'` cannot resolve —
// the build failed on exactly that. Tests have no business in dist anyway.
//
// `exclude` REPLACES the parent's rather than merging, so the three inherited
// entries are repeated here on purpose. Dropping one silently widens the build.
{
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "exclude": ["node_modules", "dist", "prisma", "src/**/*.test.ts"]
}
